        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PRDRS, Single Cylinder Port Royal Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Port Royal Single Cylinder Deadbolt is designed to fit doors 1-3/8 inches through 2 inches thick. It has an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/8 inch through 2-3/4 inch backsets. The single cylinder function means that there is a keyed lock on the exterior and a thumb-turn on the interior. Choose from brushed nickel, polished chrome, oil-rubbed bronze, or polished brass finishes. This front door lock meets ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security requirements. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by thumb-turn on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PRDR-Specifications.gif?v=1704354514\" width=\"395\" height=\"174\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PRDRS Port Royal Deadbolt Dimensions\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Deltana Port Royal Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 Security</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway compatible.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grade 2 Port Royal Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb-Turn Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PRDRS-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262316\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PRDRS Port Royal Deadbolt (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Port Royal Single Cylinder Deadbolt, Deltana PRDRS",
                "description": "Deltana PRDRS, Port Royal Single Cylinder Deadbolt - The Grade 2 Port Royal Single Cylinder Deadbolt is designed to fit doors 1-3/8 inches through 2 inches thick. It has an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/8 inch through 2-3/4 inch backsets. The single cylinder function means that there is a keyed lock on the exterior and a thumb-turn on the interior. Choose from brushed nickel, polished chrome, oil-rubbed bronze, or polished brass finishes. This front door lock meets ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security requirements.",
